<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ brand }} · Deprecation Radar</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: dark; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin:0; background:#0B1020; color:#E9EEF9; font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,"Segoe UI",sans-serif; line-height:1.55; }
  .wrap { max-width:940px; margin:0 auto; padding:2.4rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
  h1 { font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:1.7rem; letter-spacing:-.02em; margin:0; }
  h1 .b { color:#63CFC2; }
  .sub { color:#92A2BE; font-size:.88rem; margin-top:.3rem; }
  .strip { display:flex; gap:.8rem; margin:1.4rem 0 1.8rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .kpi { background:#131a2c; border:1px solid #22304F; border-radius:12px; padding:.8rem 1.1rem; flex:1; min-width:150px; }
  .kpi .k { color:#92A2BE; font-size:.68rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; }
  .kpi .v { font-family:"Archivo",sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:1.5rem; margin-top:.1rem; }
  table { border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:.9rem; }
  th { color:#92A2BE; font-size:.68rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; text-align:left; padding:.5rem .6rem; border-bottom:1px solid #22304F; }
  td { padding:.7rem .6rem; border-bottom:1px solid #171f30; vertical-align:top; }
  .mid { font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace; font-size:.82rem; }
  .pill { font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace; font-size:.66rem; padding:.12rem .5rem; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid; white-space:nowrap; }
  .pill.critical { color:#E5645C; border-color:#5a2d2d; background:#2a1414; }
  .pill.soon { color:#F2B84B; border-color:#4a3d1e; background:#221c0e; }
  .pill.watch { color:#63CFC2; border-color:#1e4a44; }
  .pill.clear { color:#92A2BE; border-color:#22304F; }
  .pill.retired { color:#5b6472; border-color:#22304F; }
  .rep { display:inline-block; font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace; font-size:.78rem; margin:.1rem .3rem .1rem 0; padding:.1rem .45rem; border:1px solid #22304F; border-radius:6px; }
  .rep .up { color:#58C07A; } .rep .down { color:#E5645C; }
  .notes { color:#92A2BE; font-size:.78rem; }
  .cta { margin-top:2rem; background:#131a2c; border:1px solid #22304F; border-radius:12px; padding:1.2rem 1.3rem; }
  .cta b { color:#F2B84B; }
  code { font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace; font-size:.82em; background:#0E1526; padding:.1rem .35rem; border-radius:4px; }
  footer { margin-top:2.4rem; color:#5b6472; font-size:.74rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1><span class="b">{{ brand }}</span> · Deprecation Radar</h1>
  <div class="sub">Which models are retiring, when, and what to move to — measured, not guessed · as of {{ today }}</div>

  <div class="strip">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="k">Tracked retirements</div><div class="v">{{ n_total }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="k">Migrate within 90 days</div><div class="v" style="color:#F2B84B">{{ n_actionable }}</div></div>
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Retires</th><th>Countdown</th><th>Move to</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for r in rows %}
      <tr>
        <td><span class="mid">{{ r.model_id }}</span><br><span class="notes">{{ r.provider }}{% if r.notes %} · {{ r.notes }}{% endif %}</span></td>
        <td class="mid">{{ r.retires_on }}</td>
        <td><span class="pill {{ r.urgency }}">{{ r.countdown }}</span></td>
        <td>
          {% for rep in r.replacements %}
            <span class="rep">{{ rep.model_id }}{% if rep.grade != "—" %} · grade {{ rep.grade }}{% endif %}{% if rep.delta %} <span class="{{ rep.delta_class }}">{{ rep.delta }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
          {% else %}
            <span class="notes">no direct replacement mapped</span>
          {% endfor %}
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="cta">
    <b>Facing one of these?</b> Don't guess which replacement holds up on <em>your</em> workload.
    Run <code>meerada pack</code> on your traffic and get a measured per-cluster gap report — pass/block,
    cost delta, and the engineer-days to migrate. Content never leaves your environment.
  </div>

  <footer>
    {{ brand }} Deprecation Radar · dates are provider-published and time-sensitive — verify before relying on them ·
    replacement grades shown where index data exists, otherwise blank (never guessed).
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
